type: software
title: "APBT Accuracy Paradox: code and data for targeted data poisoning in SARS-CoV-2 lineage classification"
abstract: "Code, frozen sequence cohort and results for a study of targeted data poisoning in SARS-CoV-2 lineage classification. The study shows how high overall accuracy can conceal lineage specific failure."
